# certifi, the one package a client lock may pin apart from the base locks
# (lock_warehouse_clients.DIVERGES). Nothing in this set caps it; it is held to
# requirements-snowflake.lock's pin because an image built with two client
# sets installs both locks into one interpreter, and every package two client
# locks share must be one version (test_toolbelt_roles
# .test_client_locks_agree_with_each_other). The BigQuery plug speaks plain
# HTTP inside the episode network, so the older bundle costs this image nothing
# it uses.
certifi==2025.1.31
